<title>USA: Starrett ends talks with Related Capital.</title>
<headline>Starrett ends talks with Related Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Starrett Corp, a real estate construction and management company, said on Thursday it had ended talks with Related Capital Co over an offer to sell shares to the company.</p>
<p>Starrett said that the talks had ended by mutual agreement of both parties, and that it is in talks with other &quot;interested parties.&quot;</p>
<p>On April 11, Starrett reported that a letter of intent involving the purchase of a 52 percent stake in the company by Related had expired.</p>
